<title>보호망 경계 회전</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f6f8; --panel:#fff; --ink:#15181e; --dim:#5c6370; --line:#dadee5;
  --road:#c5cad3; --roadq:#e5e8ed; --acc:#2f6fd0;
  --in:#2f7fe0; --out:#dc7220; --ext:#bd3a92; --intl:#1c9070; --noc:#8a929f;
  --zin:#1c9070; --zbd:#d69417; --zout:#7b8391; --znone:#bcc2cb;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --bg:#0f1217; --panel:#161a21; --ink:#e7eaee; --dim:#96a0ae; --line:#272d37;
  --road:#39414d; --roadq:#212730; --acc:#6ea3f5;
  --in:#5fa2f2; --out:#f0954a; --ext:#e263b6; --intl:#3fbf9c; --noc:#69717f;
  --zin:#3fbf9c; --zbd:#f0b543; --zout:#69717f; --znone:#39414d;
}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0f1217; --panel:#161a21; --ink:#e7eaee; --dim:#96a0ae; --line:#272d37;
  --road:#39414d; --roadq:#212730; --acc:#6ea3f5;
  --in:#5fa2f2; --out:#f0954a; --ext:#e263b6; --intl:#3fbf9c; --noc:#69717f;
  --zin:#3fbf9c; --zbd:#f0b543; --zout:#69717f; --znone:#39414d;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
  font-family:"Pretendard",system-ui,-apple-system,"Malgun Gothic","Apple SD Gothic Neo",sans-serif;
  font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,"Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
header{padding:16px 22px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}
h1{margin:0 0 3px;font-size:19px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px}
.tally{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:11px}
.chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.chip .sw{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px}
.chip b{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-left:1px}
.chip.off{opacity:.36}
.wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:214px minmax(0,1fr) 348px;height:calc(100vh - 128px);min-height:520px}
@media (max-width:1100px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;height:auto}#map{height:60vh}}
aside{border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:15px 14px;overflow:auto}
aside.rt{border-right:0;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
h2{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
h2:not(:first-child){margin-top:19px}
.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 6px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
.opt:hover{background:var(--bg)} .opt input{accent-color:var(--acc);margin:0}
.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:2px;flex:none}
.note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:9px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
#map{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);cursor:grab}
#map.drag{cursor:grabbing}
svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}
path{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
#tip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:6px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:11.5px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  max-width:280px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .1s;z-index:5}
.hint{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:10px;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);
  background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}
th{text-align:left;font-weight:600;color:var(--dim);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;
  text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
td{padding:4px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
.tr{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:flex-start;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11.5px}
.tr .d{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:99px;flex:none;margin-top:5px}
.tr code{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px}
.arrow{color:var(--dim)}
</style>

<header>
  <h1>보호망 경계 회전 — leg 구역에서 유도한 유입 · 유출 · 외부통과</h1>
  <div class="sub" id="hsub">core17legs4b · 통제 SC 17 · leg 121 · 정지선 링크 <span id="ns"></span>개에서 회전 <span id="nt"></span>개 유도 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 각 회전은 <span class="mono">from_link → connector → to_link</span> 로 VISSIM 에서 직접 읽는다</div>
  <div class="tally" id="tally"></div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <aside>
    <h2>보기</h2>
    <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="turn" checked> 회전 등급</label>
    <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="zone"> leg 구역</label>

    <h2>leg 구역</h2>
    <div id="zl"></div>

    <h2>전이표</h2>
    <table class="mono" style="font-size:11px">
      <tr><td>내부 → 내부</td><td style="color:var(--intl)">internal</td></tr>
      <tr><td>내부 → 외부</td><td style="color:var(--out)">outflow</td></tr>
      <tr><td>경계면 → 내부</td><td style="color:var(--in)">inflow</td></tr>
      <tr><td>경계면 → 외부</td><td style="color:var(--ext)">external</td></tr>
      <tr><td>외부 → 외부</td><td style="color:var(--noc)">no control</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="note">도착 구역은 회전이 닿는 링크가 <b>내부 leg</b> 소유인지로 본다. 교차로 직후 카리지웨이는 권역이 비어 있는 곳이 많아, 무소유면 하류로 걸어 처음 만나는 소유자를 쓴다.</div>
    <h2>통제 불가 경계 횡단</h2>
    <div id="unctrl"></div>

    <h2>통제 불가 내부 유입</h2>
    <div id="src"></div>
    <div class="note" id="rec"></div>
  </aside>

  <div id="map">
    <svg id="svg"><g id="g"></g></svg>
    <div id="tip"></div>
    <div class="hint">휠 확대 · 끌어 이동 · 교차로 클릭</div>
  </div>

  <aside class="rt" id="panel"></aside>
</div>

